{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ed6e58b1-7479-8c98-8da4-54b4c0dade62",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T13:32:00-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Mei Okafor",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:27:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:27:26-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Denise. My name is Mei Okafor. I'm calling to report a pothole, and also a crosswalk problem. I'm standing outside, so forgive the traffic."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:27:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear it. Take your time. Where is the pothole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:27:47-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's on the road right at the crosswalk, where people cross to the other side. I'm looking at it now. It is about two feet across, and it's gotten deeper since the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:28:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The one with the snow turning to rain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:28:09-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, last weekend's snow-to-rain storm, Sunday into Monday. It was not like this on Saturday. I walk past here every day, so I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:28:22-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That freeze and thaw does a number on the pavement. What street are you on? I'll need the nearest cross street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:28:34-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm not giving a house number, it's not at a house. It's on Thames Street, near the corner by the harbor side, at the crosswalk across from the shops."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:28:49-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thames Street at a crosswalk, near the shops. Is it in the travel lane or closer to the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:29:00-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's in the travel lane, right where the cars come through. [crosstalk] Excuse me, a truck just went by. Can you hear me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:29:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I got most of it. You said the travel lane. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:29:19-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. And the second thing. The crosswalk paint has faded. You can barely see the lines now, and cars do not stop. I stood here two minutes just now and three cars went right through while I was waiting."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:29:39-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's not safe. I'll put that in the same report so the crew looks at both. Is the paint faded across the whole crosswalk or just part?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:29:53-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The whole thing. And I would correct you on one point, it's not only the lines, the stripes are gone on the near side entirely. Faded is the polite word."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:30:09-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood, the near side stripes are gone. I'll note that exactly. Painting usually has to wait for dry, warmer weather, but I'll flag it so it's on the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:30:24-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I understand about the weather. I just want it written down so it's not forgotten."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:30:34-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It'll be written down. Do you want a call back, or just the report?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:30:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the report is fine. But if you need me, my number is 401-555-0154."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:30:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one five four. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:30:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:30:59-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. I've got the pothole in the travel lane on Thames Street at the crosswalk, about two feet across, and the faded crosswalk with cars not stopping. Anything else on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:31:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all of it. Could I get a reference number, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:31:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, let me pull it up. [pause] Okay, your reference number is PW, dash, two six, dash, zero four one seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:31:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me make sure I have this. PW, two six, zero four one seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:31:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Almost. Dash between each, but yes, that's the number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:31:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, I have it written. Thank you, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:31:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Be careful crossing out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:31:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
